<h1 style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:26px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.25;color:#0D523F;">
  A market you access was updated
</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#888B8B;">
  Market change
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  Hi {{name}},
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  A market available to your Dukka staff account was updated. Review the current details so you stay aligned with the latest configuration.
</p>

{{#> details}}
  {{> detail-row label="Name" value=marketName}}
  {{> detail-row label="Code" value=marketCode}}
  {{> detail-row label="Status" value=status}}
{{/details}}

{{#> tip title="Heads up"}}
  If this market was closed, some related workflows may pause until it is opened again. Check with your administrator if you rely on this market daily.
{{/tip}}

<p style="margin:0;">
  We notify you whenever markets you can access change.
</p>
